  "about": {
    "title": "About STREAM ADS",
    "intro": "STREAM ADS is the official advertising platform owned and run by STREAM NETWORK, built for businessmen, sellers, teachers, and creators to promote their products, videos, and services online. You can easily design, edit, and preview your advertisement for free using our dedicated Advertisement Setup page (https://streamnetwork11.streamcenter207.workers.dev/setup) with no account, email, or sign-up required. Once your ad file is ready, we charge only a very small, affordable fee to play your advertisement on the site. Simply reach out to us through the Contact tab anytime to ask about our exact pricing and get your ad published fast.\n",
    "image": "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
    "body": "Welcome to STREAM ADS, the official online classifieds, video promotion, and business advertising platform owned and run by STREAM NETWORK. As the dedicated advertising site in the STREAM NETWORK family, STREAM ADS helps businessmen, local sellers, content creators, teachers, service providers, and everyday users promote their products, videos, and services online easily and affordably.\n\nWhy Choose STREAM ADS?\nMost advertising platforms force you to create complex accounts or pay huge marketing budgets just to run a simple ad. STREAM ADS keeps everything simple, fast, and budget-friendly. Creating and previewing your advertisement on our setup tool requires no account or sign-up, and playing your advertisement on STREAM ADS costs only a very small, affordable fee. You can easily contact us through the Contact tab to ask about our current advertising rates and packages.\n\nWhat You Can Advertise on STREAM ADS:\n• Business & Commercial Promotions: Promote your shop, brand, company, or special offers to reach more customers online.\n• Video & Media Promotions: Showcase promotional videos alongside your advertisement details.\n• Buy & Sell Products: List new or used electronics, vehicles, property, and everyday items easily.\n• Education & Classes: Teachers, tutors, and institutes can publish advertisements for online classes, courses, and tuition programs.\n• Jobs & Career Opportunities: Post job vacancies or share freelance and career openings.\n• Services & Local Listings: Advertise professional services, repairs, events, and community announcements in one place.\n\nDedicated Advertisement Setup Page & Key Features\nTo make creating and managing advertisements simple for everyone, STREAM ADS provides a dedicated online Advertisement Setup tool at:\nhttps://streamnetwork11.streamcenter207.workers.dev/setup\n\nOur Advertisement Setup page comes with smart, user-friendly features built right into your browser:\n1. No Account Needed (File-Based Workflow): You do not need to log in or store personal data on our servers. Everything stays completely under your control until you download your setup file.\n2. Live Dual Preview (Ad Card & Details Page): Before submitting your advertisement, you can switch to the Preview tab to see exactly how your ad will look on the live website — including both the compact Ad Card view and the full Details Page view.\n3. Easy Future Editing (\"Open my saved file\"): If you ever want to update your price, change your text, or edit your ad later, you do not need to start from scratch. Simply click \"Open my saved file\" on the setup page, load your previously downloaded file, edit the details, and download the updated setup file again.\n4. Admin Quality Check & Custom Scheduling: Every submitted ad is reviewed by the STREAM ADS admin team to ensure quality and safety, and our team sets the final display schedule and placement for your ad and video.\n\nHow to Create and Publish Your Advertisement (Step-by-Step Guide):\nStep 1 — Open the Setup Page: Visit our official Advertisement Setup page at https://streamnetwork11.streamcenter207.workers.dev/setup on your phone or computer.\nStep 2 — Fill in Your Ad Details: Enter your advertisement title, description, contact information, and media/video details in the Setup tab.\nStep 3 — Check the Live Preview: Click \"See preview\" (or the Preview tab) to inspect how your Ad Card and Details Page look. If you want to change anything, click \"Back to edit\" and adjust it anytime.\nStep 4 — Download Your Setup File: Once you are happy with your preview, click \"Download setup file\" to save the advertisement file to your device (nothing is saved until you download this file).\nStep 5 — Contact Admin & Publish: Send your downloaded setup file to the STREAM ADS admin through the Contact tab. A small fee is charged to play your advertisement on the site — simply reach out via the Contact tab to ask about the exact pricing and get your ad scheduled live.\n\nPart of the Official STREAM NETWORK\nSTREAM ADS is proudly owned, managed, and operated by STREAM NETWORK alongside our 11 other platforms for movies (STREAM MOVIE), live sports (STREAM), worldwide live TV (STREAM LIVE), AI research (Research AI), file sharing (FILE TRANSFER), friend calls (ROOM CALL), file conversion (FILE CONVERTER), subtitle merging (SUBTITLE MERGER), online games (CARROM), live broadcasting (STREAM STUDIO), and screen recording (STREAM RECORD STUDIO).\n\nDedicated Customer Support Center & Pricing Inquiries\nWant to know the exact fee to play your advertisement, need help creating your setup file, or have questions about an existing ad? Our dedicated Customer Support Center is always ready to help. Simply visit the Contact tab on our website to get in touch with us directly.\n",
